+0.988239. Byte reassembly is unchanged (82,411,786 instructions per arm).
+Linux find-bit cases grow by 256 whole-process instructions in this screen.
+These results are not a claim of new optimizations from this continuation.
+The real three-vendor static survey completed without dropping a vendor.
